</p><p>This page lists all currently available Endless Adventures Companions.
</p><p>Note: Modders should make sure to fill out as many parts of the template as they can, to make sure players aren't confused by the entry.
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Duncan">Duncan</span></h2>
<p>Created by Jackkel Dragon
</p><p><i>Disappointed by his minor role in the first Dragon Age game, Duncan has decided to sign on as a minor companion in a fan module for some extra screen time.</i>
</p><p>Duncan
</p>
<ul><li>Male Human Rogue</li></ul>
<p>A demo addin to make sure the companion template script worked properly. Go ahead and feel bad for Duncan; he was picked because of his popularity to be the demo character and thus has nothing to say.
</p><p>Available at:
</p>
<ul><li> <a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="http://social.bioware.com/project/4771/">BSN Project Page</a></li></ul>
